  "type": "Component",
  "fields": {
    "name": "Grain Key Marshalling",
    "responsibility": "Translates between an Orleans grain's identity and the key the persisted model carries — compiling and caching, per grain type, the delegates that read a grain id into a model's record identity or database key and that build a grain id back out of a loaded model — and reads and writes the delimited byte spans a composite grain id is encoded in. It is where a grain whose key type does not match its model, or whose grain id carries no recoverable shard, is refused.",
